      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Downer Tavern, erected around 1826, served as a post office from 1956 to 1985 and was a key waypoint for National Road travelers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
